     "<div dir=\"ltr\">hola Tuyisingsize<div><br></div><div>An alternative is a simulation using of bootstrap approaches to estimate confidence intervals. </div><div><br></div><div>Using the mean and standard deviation, you could resample n times (for example a simulation of 10,000) your data.</div><div><br></div><div>saludos</div><div><br></div><div>SMandujnaoR</div></div>"
